# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Generate synthetic noise models {#generate-synthetic-noise-models}"
msgstr "Hasilkan model hingar sintetik {#generate-synthetic-noise-models}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Before creating the quantum circuits, we generate a noise model ([PauliLindbladError](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-aer/stubs/qiskit_aer.noise.PauliLindbladError.html) instance) for each of the entangling layers. We will embed them as instructions in our quantum circuits later. For each layer, we generate noise channels of varying scales. Specifically, we generate noise models with [Error Per Layered Gate (EPLG)](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/quantum-metric-layer-fidelity) of approximately ``.0004, .0008, .0012, .0016,`` and ``.002``.\n"
msgstr "Sebelum mencipta litar kuantum, kita menghasilkan model hingar (contoh [PauliLindbladError](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-aer/stubs/qiskit_aer.noise.PauliLindbladError.html)) bagi setiap lapisan berbelit. Kita akan membenamkannya sebagai arahan dalam litar kuantum kita kemudian. Bagi setiap lapisan, kita menghasilkan saluran hingar pelbagai skala. Secara khusus, kita menghasilkan model hingar dengan [Error Per Layered Gate (EPLG)](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/quantum-metric-layer-fidelity) kira-kira ``.0004, .0008, .0012, .0016,`` dan ``.002``.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create the quantum circuits {#create-the-quantum-circuits}"
msgstr "Cipta litar kuantum {#create-the-quantum-circuits}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For this demo, we simulate the time dynamics of a transverse-field Ising model (TFIM) for increasing numbers of Trotter steps (1-10 steps). For each of the 10 circuit depths, we simulate the effect of gate noise, given noise models of varying scales (``EPLGs = .0004, .0008, .0012, .0016, .002``). The noise is inserted into the ``QuantumCircuit`` as a [PauliLindbladError](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-aer/stubs/qiskit_aer.noise.PauliLindbladError.html) instruction from Qiskit Aer. The Hamiltonian considered is:\n"
msgstr "Untuk demo ini, kita mensimulasikan dinamik masa model Ising medan melintang (TFIM) bagi bilangan langkah Trotter yang meningkat (1-10 langkah). Bagi setiap 10 kedalaman litar, kita mensimulasikan kesan hingar gate, dengan model hingar pelbagai skala (``EPLGs = .0004, .0008, .0012, .0016, .002``). Hingar dimasukkan ke dalam ``QuantumCircuit`` sebagai arahan [PauliLindbladError](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-aer/stubs/qiskit_aer.noise.PauliLindbladError.html) daripada Qiskit Aer. Hamiltonian yang dipertimbangkan ialah:\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "$H = -J\\sum\\limits_{\\langle i,j \\rangle} Z_iZ_j + h\\sum\\limits_iX_i$\n"
msgstr "$H = -J\\sum\\limits_{\\langle i,j \\rangle} Z_iZ_j + h\\sum\\limits_iX_i$\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "where $J>0$ describes the coupling of nearest-neighbor spins, $i<j$, and $h$ is the global transverse field.\n"
msgstr "dengan $J>0$ menerangkan gandingan spin jiran terdekat, $i<j$, dan $h$ ialah medan melintang global.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Here we implement the time-evolved Hamiltonian across various time and noise scales. We create 60 total circuits: 10 noiseless circuits varying in Trotter depth, and 50 noisy circuits for the 10 Trotter depths across five noise scales. Given a connectivity graph, the model is parametrized by a few variables:\n"
"- ``num_steps``: The number of Trotter steps\n"
"- ``J``: Coupling strength of connected sites\n"
"- ``h``: Strength of external magnetic field\n"
"- ``dt``: Change in time across a Trotter step\n"
"- ``initial_state_angle``: An initial excitation, $R_y(\\theta)$, to be applied uniformly to all qubits\n"
msgstr ""
"Di sini kita melaksanakan Hamiltonian berevolusi masa merentasi pelbagai skala masa dan hingar. Kita mencipta 60 litar kesemuanya: 10 litar tanpa hingar yang berbeza dalam kedalaman Trotter, dan 50 litar berhingar untuk 10 kedalaman Trotter merentasi lima skala hingar. Diberi graf kesambungan, model ini diparameterkan oleh beberapa pemboleh ubah:\n"
"- ``num_steps``: Bilangan langkah Trotter\n"
"- ``J``: Kekuatan gandingan tapak yang bersambung\n"
"- ``h``: Kekuatan medan magnet luaran\n"
"- ``dt``: Perubahan masa merentasi satu langkah Trotter\n"
"- ``initial_state_angle``: Pengujaan awal, $R_y(\\theta)$, yang dikenakan secara seragam pada semua qubit\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/addons/pauli-prop/guides/simulate-noisy-expectation-values/extracted-outputs/91e18295-cd56-4245-a4ae-fa30ffb9cd14-1.avif)\n"
