# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Specify observable and run simulations {#specify-observable-and-run-simulations}"
msgstr "Tentukan observable dan jalankan simulasi {#specify-observable-and-run-simulations}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For this demo, we simulate expectation values of the average two-site correlator:\n"
msgstr "Untuk demo ini, kita mensimulasikan nilai jangkaan bagi korelator dua-tapak purata:\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "$\\langle O \\rangle = \\langle Z_{tot}^2(s) \\rangle = \\frac{1}{N^2}\\sum \\langle \\Psi(\\theta)|(\\mathscr{U}^{\\dagger})^sZ_jZ_k(\\mathscr{U})^s|\\Psi(\\theta) \\rangle$\n"
msgstr "$\\langle O \\rangle = \\langle Z_{tot}^2(s) \\rangle = \\frac{1}{N^2}\\sum \\langle \\Psi(\\theta)|(\\mathscr{U}^{\\dagger})^sZ_jZ_k(\\mathscr{U})^s|\\Psi(\\theta) \\rangle$\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "where $\\Psi(\\theta)$ corresponds to a uniform $R_y(\\theta)$ rotation on all qubits, $\\mathscr{U}^s$ describes $s$ Trotter layers, and $(j,k)$ index all connected pairs of vertices on the lattice.\n"
msgstr "dengan $\\Psi(\\theta)$ sepadan dengan putaran $R_y(\\theta)$ seragam pada semua qubit, $\\mathscr{U}^s$ menerangkan $s$ lapisan Trotter, dan $(j,k)$ mengindeks semua pasangan bucu yang bersambung pada kekisi.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Finally, we use ``pauli_prop`` to simulate observable expectation values for each of the circuits. For this nine-qubit demo, we perform all simulations **exactly**. **No Pauli propagation truncation will be performed; therefore, the differences in expectation values across the different noise models can be entirely attributed to the gate error**. The simulation process is handled in four steps:\n"
"- Evolve the Clifford gates in the circuit to the front of the circuit using ``pauli_prop.evolve_through_cliffords``\n"
"- Propagate the observable through the non-Clifford part of the circuit using ``pauli_prop.propagate_through_circuit``\n"
"  - We perform exact simulations by allowing the observable to grow to the size of the full Pauli space, $4^9$\n"
"- Propagate the evolved observable through the Clifford part of the circuit using Qiskit's ``SparsePauliOp.evolve``\n"
"- Estimate the expectation value with respect to the zero state, $|0\\rangle^{\\otimes N}$, by summing the coefficients of each diagonal term in $O$ (terms containing $Z$ or $I$ on all qubits)\n"
msgstr ""
"Akhir sekali, kita menggunakan ``pauli_prop`` untuk mensimulasikan nilai jangkaan observable bagi setiap litar. Untuk demo sembilan-qubit ini, kita melakukan semua simulasi secara **tepat**. **Tiada pemangkasan perambatan Pauli akan dilakukan; oleh itu, perbezaan nilai jangkaan merentasi model hingar yang berbeza boleh dikaitkan sepenuhnya dengan ralat gate**. Proses simulasi dikendalikan dalam empat langkah:\n"
"- Evolusikan gate Clifford dalam litar ke hadapan litar menggunakan ``pauli_prop.evolve_through_cliffords``\n"
"- Rambatkan observable melalui bahagian bukan Clifford litar menggunakan ``pauli_prop.propagate_through_circuit``\n"
"  - Kita melakukan simulasi tepat dengan membenarkan observable berkembang hingga saiz ruang Pauli penuh, $4^9$\n"
"- Rambatkan observable yang telah berevolusi melalui bahagian Clifford litar menggunakan ``SparsePauliOp.evolve`` Qiskit\n"
"- Anggarkan nilai jangkaan terhadap keadaan sifar, $|0\\rangle^{\\otimes N}$, dengan menjumlahkan pekali setiap sebutan pepenjuru dalam $O$ (sebutan yang mengandungi $Z$ atau $I$ pada semua qubit)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Observe effect of gate error on the model {#observe-effect-of-gate-error-on-the-model}"
msgstr "Perhatikan kesan ralat gate terhadap model {#observe-effect-of-gate-error-on-the-model}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Remember that, since this is a nine-qubit experiment, the Pauli propagation routine is exact, and all of the error in the noise plots can be attributed to gate error.\n"
msgstr "Ingat bahawa, memandangkan ini ialah eksperimen sembilan-qubit, rutin perambatan Pauli adalah tepat, dan semua ralat dalam plot hingar boleh dikaitkan dengan ralat gate.\n"

